AMLPSGG - Scheduling multiple ipynb
DAG Scheduling:
1.	To update the DAG you must place it in the folder of the composer > dags (folder)(e.g. gs://us-central1-testcomposer-9d6c1b93-bucket/dags)
2.	There will be a original template in the same bucket location one you create your first schedule
3.	You will be required to state the location of your .ipnyb files
4.	You will require the following roles before starting example:
!gcloud projects add-iam-policy-binding YOUR_PROJECT_ID \
    --member="serviceAccount:service-192547025355@cloudcomposer-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com" \
    --role="roles/composer.serviceAgent"
5.	Below is an example of how to edit your DAG.py, this example is to run 2 notebooks simultaneously with example notebooka as a dependency before running notebookb:
DAG with 2 notebook dependencies 
